its vanishing on the support by feasible atom addition and compact fractional mass removal. The first-variation formula and regularity are cited inputs, and the sign conclusion uses minimality.","claim_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.contact"},{"claim_id":"support.contact_derivatives","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Derives the value and slope conditions from derivatives of the contact function, with a separate right-hand expansion at zero. The origin argument retains contact at zero when zero belongs to the support and the zero-field identity q(0)=0.","claim_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.contact_derivatives"}],"query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=short&passage=contact&representation=matches","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=41f03ec0a8b1d30d68310120008da72a73f8c3f4cc88d65acbde651f5ad06a20&paper=short&passage=contact"},{"ref":"sha256:267b41919f95376c728c2f90f5c80e4bf7aa13ca3418d4931ff608c908902e54/papers/short.md/sha256:cfbe950801fd334d8fd957243fa3b1f716ef609148c5f2ff97d44f9a6443d82c/papers/short.json/passages/gap-proof","stage":"short","anchor":"gap-proof","content_span":{"start_byte":12109,"end_byte":15908,"start_line":248,"end_line":324},"section_ref":"sha256:267b41919f95376c728c2f90f5c80e4bf7aa13ca3418d4931ff608c908902e54/papers/short.md/sections/9060","section_title":"2. Minimality gives contact; curvature excludes gaps","claim_refs":["sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.empty_support_chord_obstruction","sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.no_bounded_gap","sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.no_initial_gap","sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.positiv